{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Kimagure Robot","A brilliant, slightly crazy, and extremely eccentric scientist toils away his days in his lab, creating robots to carry out different tasks. A robot to grant three wishes, a robot to help you write your diary, a robot that intentionally misbehaves in order to keep its master from becoming bored&hellip; the robots are each built for a very specific purpose, and can&rsquo;t really do much of anything else. Luckily for mankind, however, these robots are much more useful than they appear to be at first glance&hellip; most of the time, anyway.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["きまぐれロボット",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-1955","ids":{"shikimori":1955,"mal":1955,"anilist":1955,"kodik":"serial-47206"},"kodikIds":["serial-47206"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-47206":"2022-12-01T09:15:36Z"},"title":"Капризный робот","originalTitle":"Kimagure Robot","alt":"The Capricious Robot きまぐれロボット","description":"A brilliant, slightly crazy, and extremely eccentric scientist toils away his days in his lab, creating robots to carry out different tasks. A robot to grant three wishes, a robot to help you write your diary, a robot that intentionally misbehaves in order to keep its master from becoming bored&hellip; the robots are each built for a very specific purpose, and can&rsquo;t really do much of anything else. Luckily for mankind, however, these robots are much more useful than they appear to be at first glance&hellip; most of the time, anyway. (Source: Anime News Network)","year":2004,"type":"TV","genres":["Комедия","Фэнтези","Фантастика"],"rating":5.94,"popularity":771,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/1955/8c763dbf30ca21e27e8594b8157fb95d.jpeg","width":425,"height":600},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/9f8e3caa27eb45813a73bcf5ce28047f88349782.jpg","width":854,"height":480}},"releasedEpisodes"